  "bio": "Cristofer SIRC, based in Porto Alegre, Brazil, is a masterful tattoo artist renowned for his expertise in dotwork, illustrative, and geometric styles. His work is marked by a meticulous attention to detail—a hallmark of his skill level—and a unique artistic vision that brings each client's vision to stunning life. Clients can expect to receive tattoos that are not only beautifully crafted but also intricate and precise, testament to Cristofer's dedication to his craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Porto Alegre, Rio Grande Do Sul, Brazil\n\n•● Dotwork ●•\n◇ Black Work ◇\n🏠 @santamadreink",
